  "scope": "Replace remaining executable NGE class/phase profession authority with Publish 14.1 skill-box ownership, native Jedi state, and the existing hidden PRE-CU combat-skill score; retire post-NGE Officer, Force Sensitive, Smuggler, Bounty Hunter, Commando, Medic, and Entertainer player combat families while preserving their classic PRE-CU skill-box commands, stale-data cleanup, NPC behavior, and expansion content.",
