    "core3Commit": "6ea64f60ef33b89121c2a8d188b93f4bc6f158e8",
    "professionBoundary": "Publish 14.1 characters own multiple independently learned profession trees; exact novice, branch, and master skill boxes are authoritative rather than a singular NGE class template.",
    "groupBoundary": "Pinned Core3 group and player-manager implementations use outdoors_squadleader_novice for Squad Leader authority and XP.",
    "wookieeBoundary": "combat_smuggler_underworld_01 grants universal language comprehension in the authenticated Publish 14.1 skills table.",
    "jediBoundary": "jedi_padawan_novice is the authenticated common PRE-CU lightsaber-crafting root; style recipe grants remain governed by the Jedi skill tree.",
    "expansionBoundary": "Retained NGE quests, zones, schematics, terminals, droids, and dungeon interactions remain available but consult PRE-CU skill ownership.",
    "officerBoundary": "Publish 14.1 Squad Leader skill boxes remain authoritative; the later singular Officer class, of_* command family, supply-drop items, and reinforcement pets are compatibility content without player gameplay authority.",
    "gcwBannerBoundary": "Pinned Publish 14.1 has no Roadmap class banner buffs; the retained faction banner remains visual content while all nine class effects and the Commando proc are retired for players.",
    "commandoKillMeterBoundary": "The native kill meter, its damage intervals, kill awards, vigor costs, and expertise consumers belong to the retained NGE Commando class path; Publish 14.1 combat_commando players have no kill-meter resource.",
    "commandoHeavyWeaponBoundary": "Publish 14.1 Commando heavy weapons use skill-owned flame, acid, and lightning commands with authored HAM, cadence, damage, and DOT rows; the inherited NGE default-heavy-attack free action cost, devastation proc, and level-tiered passive DOT are not player progression."
  },
